Title: "Writing Text"
Id: "8ad412a7-d782-4a9b-95c6-525e6dbac9a4"

Text: "`WritingText` is the raw LaTeX text used by the `as:` section of a nested
documented `writing:` group.

```mlg-fragment
Documented:
. writing: x(i)
  as: \"x?_{i?}\"
```

It is not parsed as formulation syntax; it is rendering text with placeholder
keys such as `x?` and `i?` substituted at render time.

It is distinct from the top-level `Writing:` block, whose arguments are
double-quoted `\"name :~> body\"` writing aliases."
Id: "33684363-7626-45e8-b188-1c5df6140494"
